  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Law No. 216 of 2017 prohibits importing, manufacturing, trading, possessing or using drones without a permit from the Ministry of Defense.",
   "Penalties range from 1-7 years imprisonment and fines, up to life imprisonment for terrorist purposes and death if a person dies.",
   "Permits last up to three years, with applications decided within 30 days; silence counts as rejection.",
   "Commercial, sports or research permits need security approvals and Civil Aviation approval.",
   "Drones under 150 g without GPS, cameras, payload or long range are exempt."
